%% @title Order status lifecycle
%% @summary Statuses an order moves through after it is placed.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Pending
  Pending --> Accepted : restaurant accepts
  Pending --> Rejected : restaurant rejects
  Accepted --> Preparing
  Preparing --> OnTheWay : driver picks up
  OnTheWay --> Delivered
  Pending --> Cancelled : customer cancels
  Rejected --> [*]
  Delivered --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  class Rejected,Cancelled error
